              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bana ba bakuidi bakuabo bakabalonda ku nyima bela mpungi; Zekâya, muana wa Yonatana, muana wa Shemaya, muana wa Matanaya, muana wa Mikaya, muana wa Zaku, muana wa Asafa, ",
          "type": "text",
