              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tshisumbu tshiabo tshikuabo tshiakadi tshienda tshisakidila Nzambi, tshiakaya kusangakena nʼabo; meme nakadi ku nyima kuabo ne tshituha tshia bantu ha lumbu ku mutu kua tshibumba tshia matanda tô ne ku lumbu lunene mene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
